             "isItalic": false,
             "maxLines": "3",
             "maxLinesEnabled": false,
             "text": "If+the+switch+above+is+off,+only+PMR+will+be+created.\nIf+the+switch+above+is+on,+a+reminder+(in+calendar)+as+well+as+PMR+will+be+created+(optional)\n⚠️+Please+note+that+deleting+a+PMR+won't+delete+the+entry+from+calendar.+You+will+have+to+manually+delete+the+calendar+event\n⚠️+Also+note+that+calendar+events+are+not+supported+dynamically+via+messages+or+screen+reader.",
